# URLs that are not real targets. Deliberately minimal.
#
# Do NOT add genuinely dead links here to make the run green. The pipeline is
# report-only by design: a red external report is the deliverable, not a
# failure. Entries here are for placeholders and examples only.
^https?://example\.(com|org|net)
^https?://localhost
^https?://your-domain

# Wayback Machine snapshots. This is not an exception to the rule above.
# A snapshot at a fixed timestamp is immutable, so there is no rot to detect:
# the only thing a check here can measure is whether archive.org felt like
# answering, and it rate-limits CI aggressively. Leaving these in produced
# 4 spurious "unverifiable" entries with no signal in them. Verify a snapshot
# by hand when you add it, then trust it.
^https?://web\.archive\.org/
